## 💡 Menene KMS Pico?

**KMS Pico Server** siga ce ta musamman da ke juya kwamfutarka ta zama **sabar Key Management Service (KMS)** na gida. Microsoft ta ƙirƙiri KMS da farko domin manyan kamfanoni su iya kunna daruruwan na'urori ta hanyar sabar ɗaya ta ciki.

Wannan sigar ta Server tana ba da damar kunna **Windows 10 da Office** daga na'ura ɗaya, kuma tana sabunta kanta kowace rana ta atomatik na tsawon **kwanaki 180**.

### Muhimman Sassan

| Sassan | Aiki |
|--------|------|
| 🖥️ **Sabar KMS ta gida** | Yana aiki a bango |
| 🔑 **Makullin GVLK** | Makullin lasisi na gama-gari |
| ⏱️ **Zagayowar kwana 180** | Kowace tokan tana aiki watanni shida |
| 🔄 **Aikin sabuntawa** | Sake kunnawa kowace rana |

