## 🛠️ Mataki-mataki

### Mataki 1 — Shirya Tsarin

**Windows Security → Virus & threat protection → Manage settings → Real-time protection → Off**.

Ƙara babban fayil da aka ware:

```
Settings → Privacy & security → Windows Security
→ Virus & threat protection → Exclusions → Add folder
```

### Mataki 2 — Fitar da Kundin

Danna dama kan fayil → **Extract All…** → zaɓi babban fayil.

### Mataki 3 — Gudanar da Shugaba

Nemo `KmsPicoServer.exe` → danna dama → **Run as administrator**.

> 💡 Idan SmartScreen ya bayyana: **More info → Run anyway**.

