### Mataki 4 — Kafa Sabar KMS

A babban taga, danna **Kunnawa**, sannan **Kafa sabar KMS**. Sassan za su kasance cikin `C:\Windows\KmsPicoServer`.

### Mataki 5 — Kunna Windows

Danna **Kunna Windows**. Bayan 'yan dakiku za ka ga alamar kore.

### Mataki 6 — Tabbatar da Kunnawa

Buɗe **Command Prompt** a matsayin shugaba:

```bash
slmgr /xpr
```

Idan ya yi nasara, za ka ga **"an kunna har abada"**.

Don ƙarin bayani:

```bash
slmgr /dlv
```

### Mataki 7 — Tabbatar da Sabuntawa

Buɗe **Task Scheduler → Library** ka duba aikin KmsPicoServer.

### Mataki 8 — Mayar da Antivirus

Sake kunna kariyar lokaci na gaske sannan ka ƙara babban fayil ɗin KMS a cikin keɓancewa.

### Mataki 9 — Kunna Office (Zaɓi)

Je zuwa shafin **Office** ka danna **Kunna Office**.

### Mataki 10 — Bincike na Ƙarshe

**Settings → Update & Security → Activation** → tabbatar "An kunna Windows".

