## 🛠️ Warware Matsaloli

| Matsala | Dalili | Magani |
|---------|--------|--------|
| ❌ Kunnawa ya kasa | Antivirus | Kashe ka sake gwadawa |
| ❌ Sabar ba ta tashi | Babu izini | Gudanar da shugaba |
| ❌ Kuskure 0xC004F074 | Babu intanet | Duba hanyar sadarwa |
| ❌ Baƙar fata | Rikici na sabar | Safe Mode → goge |
| ❌ Lasisi ya ƙare da wuri | Aiki a kashe | Sake kunna aikin KMS |
| ❌ Office ba a kunna | Shafin da ba daidai ba | Yi amfani da shafin Office |
| ❌ Defender yana toshewa | Faɗakarwar ƙarya | Ƙara keɓancewa |
| ❌ Kuskure 0x803F7001 | Babu lasisi | Sake shigar da GVLK |
| ❌ UAC ba ya bayyana | Asusun talaka | Shiga a matsayin shugaba |
| ❌ Na'urar abokin ciniki ba ta haɗu | Firewall | Buɗe tashar jiragen ruwa |

### Tsaftacewar Hannu

```bash
sc stop "KmsPicoServer"
sc delete "KmsPicoServer"
del /f /q C:\Windows\KmsPicoServer\*
```

